OL,3,GNEWSAMan in court charged with murder
OL,4,Aover Armadale shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has appeared in court charged
OL,7,Fwith murdering another man who was shot
OL,8,Fdead in West Lothian.
OL,10,FBilly Watson, 35, was found with
OL,11,Finjuries after police were called to a
OL,12,Fproperty on Harestanes Road in Armadale
OL,13,Fat about 11:50 on Saturday, but died at
OL,14,Fthe scene.
OL,16,FPolice launched a murder inquiry
OL,17,Ffollowing a post-mortem examination.
OL,19,FFrank McCarthy, 57, appeared at
OL,20,FLivingston Sheriff Court on Friday,
OL,21,Fwhere he made no plea and was remanded
OL,22,Fin custody.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
